      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能使吾的光芒变得鲜明耀眼的\n并非是阳光充沛的安稳之地，\n而是乌云密布的艰困环境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a49dbead7e75fce3c01407f3cdfdbd7f8a94f3753c78a5ba593dd5092c49ee",
