      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是因为今天的表现，\n大家才期待吾能夺得经典三冠吗？\n他们都已经期望能够看见更加残酷的破坏了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "72f8068d4f1af41023f9113c44f261dd95e3ff07240d20d67bddd6122794232f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
