    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7177542ea6b3331cfa988e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "通往“MC参赛计划”的道路将会变得更加严峻。\n很好！正是因为没有人愿意踏上这条路，\n我才会是谷野美酒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e318d95936c17301f55477448d583a2c182446de904b67c62659179236c2926d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
