      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbf6fea944bba5fed4e4711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………好，下一场比赛就选“皋月赏”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03146524bcfe11cefcfab0a989fda8934e4aa60f86381f055d27d90bb6a8a19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc875f69b633cd7a937b65c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………好，下一场比赛就选“皋月赏”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03146524bcfe11cefcfab0a989fda8934e4aa60f86381f055d27d90bb6a8a19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbe289e33c6830ce53d518dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──而且，\n因为谷野美酒是这样的人，\n我才会想要支持她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "929add4f800a4ce83fe60dd9d71db3d23d8742b7f14adc340e6b02d36db093ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bef41781b2d096b53303180c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我们决定下一个目标是“皋月赏”，\n迈步走向春季GⅠ战线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a819a34302119854101b1970a7b5d425fab20b42b0ceede54b1fa6599a75234",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb0ed36aac22ba7e9c5a045",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“神赞纪念”结束后，过了几天──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ba14b251f7fe0a9bc8cbdaeb97f348468a7aa1f52a90bda26dc2b620e9e60d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1dd56125ee70933cd1dbcdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e63f64ae1904fcf07bab0ada331d13e164e5dd9cfb8cdad386ace12e23d08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1084/storytimeline_501084304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
